        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Paul OConnor from CASTLE ESTATE AGENTSis delighted to offer this superbly presented four-bedroom semi-detached family home, with Large Kitchen Extension ,meticulously maintained in pristine condition throughout. Located in this very popular and sought-after development, this is one of the few four bedroomed homes available for sale today in Palmerstown. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the many benefits and features this property has to offer.\r\n\r\n*Superbly Presented in Pristine Condition\r\n*Four Bedrooms\r\n*Three Bathrooms (including Master Ensuite and WC)\r\n*Two Receptions\r\n*Extended Modern Walnut Kitchen\r\n*Cobblelock Driveway\r\n*Abundance of Fitted Wardrobes\r\n*BER: C2 (No 102951910)\r\n*Floor Area: 112Sq. Mtrs (1250 Sq. Ft)\r\n*Double Glazed PVC Windows\r\n*Gas Central Heating\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nWest facing Garden , double glazed windows  throughout.\r\nHall 5.46x1.97m Laminate flooring\r\nGuest WC/WHB With tiled splashback, tiled floor\r\nSeparate Cloakroom Tiled floor, gas central heating boiler\r\nLounge 5.27 into bay window x 3.47m Fireplace, laminate flooring, coving to ceiling, double doors to\r\nDining Room 3.45x2.70m Double glazed sliding patio doors, laminate flooring, coving to ceiling\r\nExtended Kitchen/Breakfast Room 6.67x2.73m With concealed lighting beneath, walnut style units, work surfaces incorporating electric hob and oven beneath with single drainer stainless steel sink unit and mixer tap, tiled walls and floor, door to garden\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nLanding With hot press, access to attic with light and partly floored\r\nBathroom 2.07x1.71m Fully tiled walls and floor, white bathroom suite comprising bath, wc, whb, electric shower\r\nBedroom 1 4.61 into bay window x3.32m Front aspect, floor to ceiling triple wardrobes in addition to double wardrobe, laminate flooring\r\nMaster Ensuite With shower, wc, whb, contemporary style, fully tiled walls and floor\r\nBedroom 2 3.17x2.78m Rear aspect, floor to ceiling triple wardrobes, laminate flooring\r\nBedroom 3 2.67x2.15m Rear aspect, floor to ceiling triple wardrobes, laminate flooring\r\nBedroom 4 2.87x2.17m Front aspect, floor to ceiling triple wardrobes, laminate flooring\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE: To the front, there is a full cobblelock walled driveway providing off-street parking for two cars. To the side, there is a side entrance. To the rear, there is a lawn, and patio area ."
      },
